---
/**
 * Contact.
 *
 * One address, because one address is what exists and is answered. A page that
 * lists five routes and answers one is worse than a page that lists one.
 *
 * The phone number and the three accounts below are the ones the Foundation
 * confirmed. Each was checked to resolve before it was linked; a dead account
 * on a contact page is worse than no account. If one is closed, take it out
 * here rather than leaving it to rot.
 */
import Doc from '../layouts/Doc.astro';
---

<Doc
	title="Contact — The Itti Foundation"
	description="How to reach The Itti Foundation, what to write about, and how long we take to answer."
	eyebrow="Contact"
	heading="How to reach us."
	lede="An address, a number, and the places we post. All of them reach people."
>
	<section class="doc__section">
		<h2 class="doc__h">Write to us</h2>
		<div class="doc__body">
			<p>
				<a class="doc__link" href="mailto:hello@itti.org.in">hello@itti.org.in</a>{' '}
				&mdash; for anything at all. It is read by people at the Foundation, not by a ticketing
				system, and we answer within five working days.
			</p>
			<p>
				You do not need to know which part of the Foundation your question belongs to.
				Send it and we will pass it to whoever should have it.
			</p>
			<p>
				If you would rather speak to someone:{' '}
				<a class="doc__link" href="tel:+918928263631">+91 89282 63631</a>. It is a
				working number rather than a staffed line, so you may reach us or you may not
				&mdash; if nobody answers, write instead and we will come back to you.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="doc__section">
		<h2 class="doc__h">Where we post</h2>
		<div class="doc__body">
			<p>
				What we are doing, as we do it. Messages sent to these reach us too, though more
				slowly than the address above.
			</p>
			<dl class="doc__list">
				<dt>Instagram</dt>
				<dd>
					<a
						class="doc__link"
						href="https://www.instagram.com/ittifoundation/"
						rel="me noopener">@ittifoundation</a
					>
				</dd>
				<dt>Facebook</dt>
				<dd>
					<a
						class="doc__link"
						href="https://www.facebook.com/ittifoundation"
						rel="me noopener">@ittifoundation</a
					>
				</dd>
				<dt>YouTube</dt>
				<dd>
					<a
						class="doc__link"
						href="https://www.youtube.com/@ittifoundation"
						rel="me noopener">@ittifoundation</a
					>
				</dd>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="doc__section">
		<h2 class="doc__h">What to say</h2>
		<div class="doc__body">
			<p>
				Nothing formal. It helps if you tell us roughly what you are writing about,
				because it decides who reads it next.
			</p>
			<dl class="doc__list">
				<dt>Wanting to take part</dt>
				<dd>
					Whether as someone we can help, someone caring for another person, a volunteer
					or a partner. The quickest route is{' '}
					<a class="doc__link" href="/join">the registration form</a>, which asks the
					few things we need to reach you properly &mdash; but an email is fine.
				</dd>
				<dt>Your details, and what we hold</dt>
				<dd>
					To see, correct or delete anything we hold about you. <strong
						>Anuja Bali</strong
					> answers these. What we keep and why is set out in{' '}
					<a class="doc__link" href="/privacy">What we hold, and why</a>.
				</dd>
				<dt>Something on the site is broken</dt>
				<dd>
					Including anything you could not read, could not reach with a keyboard, or
					that behaved strangely. See{' '}
					<a class="doc__link" href="/accessibility">Accessibility</a> for what we already
					know is wrong.
				</dd>
				<dt>Working with us</dt>
				<dd>
					Press, partnership, or an organisation wanting to do something together. Say
					what you have in mind and who you are.
				</dd>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="doc__section">
		<h2 class="doc__h">What we are not</h2>
		<div class="doc__body">
			<p>
				We are not a crisis line and not a medical service. None of the routes above is
				watched overnight &mdash; not the address, not the number, not the accounts
				&mdash; and five working days is far too slow to be any use to someone in
				danger.
			</p>
			<p>
				If you or someone near you needs help now, contact your local emergency
				services, or a crisis line in your country. Please do not wait on us.
			</p>
			<p>
				Nothing we write back is medical, legal or financial advice. See{' '}
				<a class="doc__link" href="/terms">the terms of this site</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Doc>
